  _slides:
  - text: First, lets get a feel for the controls. Use WASD to move and F to flip
      the camera backwards
    usesImage: 0
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Purrrfect. Next, try to throw your blue yarn at the red yarn so that it
      reaches Keito.
    usesImage: 0
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Hmmm, that didn\u2019t work. Was it too small for Keito to play with?
      Try making the red yarn bigger by knocking it into another red yarn ball."
    usesImage: 0
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Look! The red yarn ball is bigger! Try giving Keito the red yarn to see
      what happens.
    usesImage: 0
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - text: YAYYY! Keito is now playing with the yarn ball, not destroying the room,
      but it still needs to be entertained! So try to fill its joy bar by giving
      more yarn.
    usesImage: 0
    image: {fileID: 0}
